<title>NETHERLANDS: Dutch PTT to buy stake in direct mail firm.</title>
<headline>Dutch PTT to buy stake in direct mail firm.</headline>
<dateline>THE HAGUE 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch post and telecoms group PTT Nederland NV said on Tuesday it intends to buy 30 percent of Datus/CAK, a firm specialised in address database management and direct marketing services.</p>
<p>The Nieuwegein-based firm employs 90 staff. Sales figures were not disclosed.</p>
<p>In anticipation of the final agreement, the two firms would start cooperation as from today, PTT said.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
